    {
      "id": "claim_c1a897c7ae6d4c1db212303a746ae389",
      "statement": "The instance identity keypair is resolved database first, then from the data_dir file, then generated, with a file-loaded or newly generated key synced back to the instance_identity table — so a pod without a persistent volume still keeps a stable instance identity across restarts.",
